 "name": "动物厨房 Tasty Chef",
 "steam_appid": 5019920,
 "required_age": 0,
 "is_free": false,
 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a56ff1926300c390065fa1b2d790b34f.avif?t=1788752359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras_big/a56ff1926300c390065fa1b2d790b34f.avif?t=1788752359 width=1560 height=630 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>从亲手做出第一杯饮品，到经营一间能够自行运转的餐厅</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>《动物厨房 Tasty Chef》</strong>是一款结合动手烹饪、自由布局、库存管理与员工协作的餐厅经营游戏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">从一家温馨的奶茶店开始，设计菜单、采购食材、规划厨房，并亲自应对每一次营业高峰。随着生意不断成长，再把重复的工作交给员工，逐步建立属于自己的餐饮事业。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>每一杯，都由你亲手完成</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">接下订单，拿取杯子，准备茶底、牛奶、糖浆、冰块与小料，再封杯交给等待中的顾客。不同餐点拥有各自的制作步骤；熟悉配方和设备，才能在订单堆积前稳住出餐节奏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/d5fadb17601494bb9e5806fe94a9c539.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/d5fadb17601494bb9e5806fe94a9c539.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/d5fadb17601494bb9e5806fe94a9c539.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>不只是装修，更要设计工作流程</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">扩建经营空间，自由摆放和调整烹饪设备、工作台与储物设施。杯子放在哪里、设备之间相隔多远、补货路线是否顺畅，都会影响整间餐厅的效率。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">你可以打造赏心悦目的小店，也可以反复优化厨房动线，让每一个订单更快完成。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a97f94fd6c97a62fb2d28a378eff0eca.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a97f94fd6c97a62fb2d28a378eff0eca.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a97f94fd6c97a62fb2d28a378eff0eca.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>今天卖什么，由你决定</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">解锁新菜谱，自由选择当天供应的餐点，关闭暂时不想制作的配方，并设置可选小料、冰量与口味。菜单不仅决定顾客会点什么，也会改变厨房需要准备的设备、原料和库存。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">营业结束后，别忘了查看结算、采购食材、补充仓库，并为下一天重新安排菜单与团队。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/bf398f4197723f6a9173229e8e81eeb4.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/bf398f4197723f6a9173229e8e81eeb4.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/bf398f4197723f6a9173229e8e81eeb4.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>把手忙脚乱，变成各司其职</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">招募可靠的动物员工，为他们安排接单、制作、出餐和补货等工作，并调整任务优先级。随着团队成长，员工能够逐渐接手日常流程；客流高峰到来时，你也可以随时回到厨房亲自帮忙。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">从一个人包办所有工作，到亲眼看着整家餐厅顺畅运转，这就是经营成长的一部分。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/c2124597d50f24cb5c13836c1a399851.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/c2124597d50f24cb5c13836c1a399851.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/c2124597d50f24cb5c13836c1a399851.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>从一家小店，发展成自己的美食事业</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">从奶茶店起步，随着游戏推进，进入寿司店、面包房等各具特色的餐厅。每间餐厅都有独特的菜谱、设备、制作流程与经营机制，需要你重新规划空间并建立适合它的工作方式。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">这里没有传统的固定关卡。每间餐厅都是一项可以持续扩建、优化与个性化经营的事业。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/e5bbdf9f1ec00b8d66b8b3cd83b41613.avif?t=1788752359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras_big/e5bbdf9f1ec00b8d66b8b3cd83b41613.webp?t=1788752359 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>独自经营，或与好友一起开店</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">你可以独自管理整间餐厅，让员工协助处理日常工作；也可以与好友一起游玩，分别负责接单、制作、出餐和补货，让每个区域都能顺畅衔接。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">无论你喜欢亲手烹饪、研究高效动线、管理库存，还是培养一支能够自行运转的团队，都可以按照自己的方式经营理想餐厅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a74291bed36f73fd3db6164fb7fb8993.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a74291bed36f73fd3db6164fb7fb8993.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a74291bed36f73fd3db6164fb7fb8993.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你将体验</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 拥有独特步骤的动手烹饪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 可以自由扩建与布置的餐厅</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 菜单、配方、口味与库存管理</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 能够实际参与工作的动物员工</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 拥有不同机制与流程的特色餐厅</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 单人经营与好友合作游玩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 色彩明快、轻松治愈的 2.5D 视角全 3D 场景</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>从第一杯饮品开始，打造属于你的美食事业。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">QQ交流群：167610784</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">欢迎关注我们的小红书官方号《Xpercent游戏工作室》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/6b0f5d5facc99d6229635e9af6760283.avif?t=1788752359\" width=500 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
