\"text-align: center\">从一个人包办所有工作，到亲眼看着整家餐厅顺畅运转，这就是经营成长的一部分。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/c2124597d50f24cb5c13836c1a399851.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/c2124597d50f24cb5c13836c1a399851.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/c2124597d50f24cb5c13836c1a399851.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>从一家小店，发展成自己的美食事业</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">从奶茶店起步，随着游戏推进，进入寿司店、面包房等各具特色的餐厅。每间餐厅都有独特的菜谱、设备、制作流程与经营机制，需要你重新规划空间并建立适合它的工作方式。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">这里没有传统的固定关卡。每间餐厅都是一项可以持续扩建、优化与个性化经营的事业。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/e5bbdf9f1ec00b8d66b8b3cd83b41613.avif?t=1788752359\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras_big/e5bbdf9f1ec00b8d66b8b3cd83b41613.webp?t=1788752359 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>独自经营，或与好友一起开店</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">你可以独自管理整间餐厅，让员工协助处理日常工作；也可以与好友一起游玩，分别负责接单、制作、出餐和补货，让每个区域都能顺畅衔接。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">无论你喜欢亲手烹饪、研究高效动线、管理库存，还是培养一支能够自行运转的团队，都可以按照自己的方式经营理想餐厅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a74291bed36f73fd3db6164fb7fb8993.poster.avif?t=1788752359\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a74291bed36f73fd3db6164fb7fb8993.webm?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/a74291bed36f73fd3db6164fb7fb8993.mp4?t=1788752359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你将体验</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 拥有独特步骤的动手烹饪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 可以自由扩建与布置的餐厅</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 菜单、配方、口味与库存管理</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 能够实际参与工作的动物员工</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 拥有不同机制与流程的特色餐厅</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 单人经营与好友合作游玩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 色彩明快、轻松治愈的 2.5D 视角全 3D 场景</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>从第一杯饮品开始，打造属于你的美食事业。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">QQ交流群：167610784</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">欢迎关注我们的小红书官方号《Xpercent游戏工作室》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019920/extras/6b0f5d5facc99d6229635e9af6760283.avif?t=1788752359\" width=500 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
 "short_description": "《动物厨房 Tasty Chef》是一款轻松治愈的餐厅模拟经营与烹饪游戏。你将亲自接单、备菜、制作餐点和服务顾客，同时采购食材、扩建经营空间并自由摆放各种设施。设计菜单、定制不同口味，还能雇用员工协助补货和做菜。从奶茶店起步，逐步解锁拥有独特菜谱和玩法机制的寿司店、面包房等特色餐厅，打造属于自己的美食事业。",
